          "details": "<p>As long as <strong>Pepel Zorya Unleash</strong>'s <strong>Fire Emblem: Lingering Flame</strong> is active, <strong>Lingering Flame </strong>will NOT be removed from the scene when its <strong>Hit Points</strong> is <strong>0.</strong></p>\n<p>Also, <strong>Lingering Flame </strong>can take maximum damage of <strong>1 </strong>(before applying affinities) for each attack.</p>",
